Review F7: a WCS LINE and a CIRCLE carrying extrusion (0,0,-1).
999
DXF stores LINE in world coordinates and CIRCLE/ARC in the entity's own system,
999
so ignoring code 210 mixes two frames in one file: this hole belongs at
999
(25,30) and would silently import at (-25,30). A mirrored part has identical
999
area, volume and mass, so no analytical oracle can catch it -- which is why the
999
entity is refused rather than guessed at.
